# 三处能力的真服基准：
#
#   1. `/summon` / `/entitydata` 的 `Rotation` 落到实体朝向
#   2. trigger 的锁（`ScoreboardScore`）
#   3. tellraw / title 的 JSON 组件
#
# 能看到的与看不到的：
#   - 朝向：`execute @e[ry=...] ~ ~ ~ say` 会打在控制台上。
#   - trigger 的成功回显是**发给玩家**的（而且只在创造模式发），控制台看不到；
#     控制台能看到的是 `execute` 的失败汇总。分数本身用 `players list` 看。
#   - tellraw 的正文也是发给玩家的，控制台看不到；但**组件坏掉**时命令自己
#     失败，错误会打在控制台上——这是 JSON 组件这一条能验的部分。
#
# bot: Steve

--- console ---
say U01
scoreboard objectives add t trigger
say U02
scoreboard players set Steve t 0
say U03
execute Steve ~ ~ ~ trigger t add 3
say U04
execute Steve ~ ~ ~ trigger t add 1
say U05
scoreboard players list Steve
say U06
scoreboard players enable Steve t
say U07
execute Steve ~ ~ ~ trigger t set 7
say U08
scoreboard players list Steve
say U09
summon armor_stand 0 4 0 {Rotation:[90f,45f]}
say U10
execute @e[ry=90,rym=90] ~ ~ ~ say turned
say U11
entitydata @e[type=armor_stand] {Rotation:[10f,-20f]}
say U12
execute @e[ry=10,rym=10] ~ ~ ~ say ten
say U13
summon armor_stand 2 4 0 {Rotation:[90,45]}
say U14
execute @e[ry=90,rym=90] ~ ~ ~ say intlist
say U15
scoreboard objectives add n dummy
say U16
scoreboard players set Steve n 42
say U17
tellraw Steve {"text":"a","extra":[{"text":"b"}]}
say U18
tellraw Steve {"score":{"name":"Steve","objective":"n"}}
say U19
tellraw Steve {"score":{"name":"*","objective":"n"}}
say U20
tellraw Steve {"score":{"name":"@e[type=zombie]","objective":"n"}}
say U21
tellraw Steve {"selector":"@a"}
say U22
tellraw Steve {"translate":"chat.type.text","with":[{"text":"Steve"},{"text":"hi"}]}
say U23
tellraw Steve {"text":"x","clickEvent":{"action":"bogus","value":"y"}}
say U24
title Steve title {"text":"hi"}
say U25
title Steve title {"text":"hi","hoverEvent":{"action":"bogus","value":"x"}}
say U26
scoreboard players list Steve
